      By 4:15 the bag holds a <b>Candle</b> and a box of <b>Matches</b>, both picked up around the counter. Combine them from the inventory and you get a <b>lit candle</b>. The recording does this at 4:17 and then walks straight into the stockroom, which is the only part of the level where a light source is worth carrying; the front of the shop is lit, the back is not.
