      Two small pickups finish the stockroom: a <b>Handle</b> at 5:24, which is the sort of item you only understand when you find the drawer it fits, and a <b>Pencil</b> at 5:27, which is the most important object in the back half of the level. The pencil is worthless on its own. With the piece of paper from the scroll, it becomes the clue for the locker.
