      One more puzzle sits between the sole board and the sneaker: a maze drawn as a plan view, with a small pink marker that you drag through it. The recording works the marker from the opening on one side to the middle without touching a wall, then takes what the maze releases. If a drag jumps a wall the marker resets, so move it a corridor at a time rather than in one sweep — the walls are thin at this zoom level and a fast drag will cut a corner.
